  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "行政領導與人脈經營",
    "sub_ename": "ADMINISTRATION LEADERSHIP AND INTERPERSONAL RELATIONSHIP",
    "describe_ch": "「行政領導」是一門課程，而「人際關係」也是一門課程，良好的人際關係有助於行政領導，因此這兩個課程具有密切的相關性，可讓領導的地位更形鞏固，使學生溝通能力便強及了解行政領導與如何加強自己之人際關係，促進領導能力。",
    "describe_eh": "Administrative leadership is a course, and interpersonal relationship is also a course. Good interpersonal relationships enhance administration leadership; therefore, the two courses are closely related and make administration leadership more stable. This Course Improve students' communication skills , help students understand administration leadership, will also strengthen personal relationships, and build leadership skills",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
